    "dynamic_instructions": "{\r\n  \"datasetView\": \"**Train Tree 1**\\n\\nGoal: Train your model and test it for your user.\\n\\n1. In **Predict**, choose the label from My Data in your guide.\\n2. In **Using**, choose the two features you put on your map in Define Stop 3.\\n3. Click **Train model**.\\n\\nYou are done when your tree shows. Go to the **Testing** tab.\",\r\n  \"results\": \"**Train Tree 1**\\n\\nGoal: Train your model and test it for your user.\\n\\n1. Find your **Accuracy** at the top. Write it in **Tree 1** in your guide.\\n2. Click **Accuracy**. Write how many test records are **Correct**, out of all the test records.\\n3. Reread your user in Define Stop 2. In **Make a Prediction**, choose the category your user would pick for each feature.\\n4. Write those categories in Tree 1 in your guide.\\n5. Click **Predict**. Write the prediction in Tree 1 in your guide.\\n6. Click **Save image** (the camera under your tree). Click **Save to Backpack**.\\n\\nYou are done when Tree 1 in your guide is full and your tree is in your Backpack.\\n\\nThink about: Which of your two features did your tree ask about? Why?\"\r\n}",
